language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit DeliveryScheduler.
capability BoundedUiDelivery.
functionality ScheduleUiDelivery.
functionality CoalescePresentationPatch.
functionality DeliverDurableOutcome.
functionality ReportDiagnosticLoss.

UIRuntime contains DeliveryScheduler.
DeliveryScheduler provides BoundedUiDelivery.
DeliveryScheduler status proposed.
DeliveryScheduler cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
DeliveryScheduler owns ScheduleUiDelivery.
ScheduleUiDelivery realizes BoundedUiDelivery.
ScheduleUiDelivery specifies "Independent realtime/bulk/durable lanes with bounded work; per-binding cadence is separate from producer/projection/frame cadence.".
DeliveryScheduler owns CoalescePresentationPatch.
CoalescePresentationPatch realizes BoundedUiDelivery.
CoalescePresentationPatch specifies "Latest/coalesced updates only for declared supersedable presentation; authority/replay state remains intact.".
DeliveryScheduler owns DeliverDurableOutcome.
DeliverDurableOutcome realizes BoundedUiDelivery.
DeliverDurableOutcome specifies "Ordered command/config/session/error outcomes cannot be dropped by latest-wins; report explicit capacity failure.".
DeliveryScheduler owns ReportDiagnosticLoss.
ReportDiagnosticLoss realizes BoundedUiDelivery.
ReportDiagnosticLoss specifies "Bounded diagnostics and drop accounting; no false delivery gap from intentional filtering/coalescing.".
